==============================================================================================================================
  a typical lens: log10 M_b = 10.61, LambdaCDM log10 M200 = 12.00
    R [Mpc]  Ups(LambdaCDM)   Ups_phantom cano    Ups_phantom alt   E_G/E_G(GR)
       1.00          0.3428            -0.0001            -0.0002         1.000
